also be appropriate,\n        such as plain text over HTTP, or JPEG image over HTTP.\n        Content types not intented primarily for viewing by a human user, or not\n        widely-supported in web browsing clients, should not be advertised as\n        DNS-SD service type \"http\", even if they do happen to be transported over HTTP.\n        Such types should be advertised as their own logical service type with their\n        own DNS-SD service type, for example, XUL (XML User Interface Language)\n        transported over HTTP is advertised explicitly as DNS-SD service type \"xul-http\".","port":80,"protocol":"tcp","source":"iana","status":"assigned"},"RjBegP-KDr7qY6B9":{"assignee":"[Mark_McCahill]","contact":"[Mark_McCahill]","description":"Gopher","name":"gopher","port":70,"protocol":"tcp","source":"iana","status":"assigned"},"SQgSS6d_iE3JA7AM":{"assignee":"[Mark_McCahill]","contact":"[Mark_McCahill]","description":"Gopher","name":"gopher","port":70,"protocol":"udp","source":"iana","status":"assigned"},"TeSUUpgui3NczmYC":{"assignee":"[Jack_Haverty]","contact":"[Jack_Haverty]","description":"Oracle SQL*NET","name":"sql*net","notes":"This entry is an alias to \"sql-net\".\nThis entry is now historic, not usable for use with many\ncommon service discovery mechanisms.","port":66,"protocol":"tcp","source":"iana","status":"assigned"},"UA5hugexj86Kgg-a":{"assignee":"[Charles_Watt]","contact":"[Charles_Watt]","description":"DNSIX Securit Attribute Token Map","name":"dnsix","port":90,"protocol":"udp","source":"iana","status":"assigned","unauthorized_use_reported":"PORT 90 also being used unofficially by Pointcast"},"Uq9asYEyEPpsXjXB":{"description":"Bootstrap Protocol Server","name":"bootps","port":67,"protocol":"udp","source":"iana","status":"assigned"},"UzNAvtfrPQiwpKUp":{"assignee":"[Mark_Crispin]","contact":"[Mark_Crispin]","description":"SU/MIT Telnet Gateway","name":"su-mit-tg","port":89,"protocol":"tcp","source":"iana","status":"assigned"},"VZW6viMHqGRSlW7q":{"ass